<http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#Facilitador_moderado> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Facilita la función corporal de forma moderada." .
# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#Forma_tecnica
<http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#Forma_tecnica> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
