<https://juancarlosnajar.github.io/AikidoOntology/aikido#Actividades_fisicas> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://juancarlosnajar.github.io/AikidoOntology/aikido#Tipos_Actividad> .
