<https://juancarlosnajar.github.io/AikidoOntology/aikido#b330_funciones_fluidez_y_ritmo> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
