<http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#flexibilidad> <http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#usa_funcion> <http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#b715> .
