# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#mae_ukemi
<http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#mae_ukemi> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#mae_ukemi> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#Ukemi> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#mae_ukemi> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Caida hacia adelante, sin rodar." .
