<http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#tachi_waza_gyaku_hanmi_katate_dori_yonkyo> <http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#tiene_waza> <http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#tachi_waza> .
