# 
# http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#tenkan
<http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#tenkan> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#tenkan> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#Tai_sabaki> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/juancarlos/ontologies/2025/4/aikido#tenkan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "El cuerpo gira 180º, pivotándo sobre el pie adelantado, y atrasando, a continuación el otro pie." .
# 
