<https://juancarlosnajar.github.io/AikidoOntology/aikido#el_oso_y_el_cangrejo> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://juancarlosnajar.github.io/AikidoOntology/aikido#Actividades_fisicas> .
